= The Northern Expedition

Four years ago, Sun Yat-sen planned the Northern Expedition. This was cut short after Chen Jiongming rebelled. 

Three years later, Sun Yat-sen passed away. In the midst of the chaos, [+ kmt_leader +] emerged victorious.

In the following months, the Guomindang prepared. Now, what is the result of this preparation?

- @one: The Army.

@one
go-to: winarmy if nra_power >= 4; losearmy if nra_power <= 4

@winarmy
face-image: img/nrastreet.jpg

The army is <span style="color: #66BB6A;">very ready</span> for the campaign. We have [+ nra_strength +] thousand soldiers ready and armed to fight.

- @two: The United Front.

@losearmy
face-image: img/nrastreet.jpg

The army is <span style="color: #d42f2f;">less than ready</span>, we will have to improvise during our campaign.

- @two: The United Front.

@two
go-to: winfront if cpc_relation >= 50; losefront if cpc_relation < 50

@winfront
face-image: img/cpc.jpg

Our alliance with the Chinese Communist Party is <span style="color: #66BB6A;">still strong</span>, even after some unsavory moments.

- @three: The Warlords.

@losefront
face-image: img/cpc.jpg

Our alliance with the Chinese Communist Party is <span style="color: #d42f2f;">tenuous, if not hostile</span>. We probably won't get their services in peasant recruiting.

- @three: The Warlords.

@three
face-image: img/portraits/TangShengzhi.jpg
on-arrival: nra_strength += 20;

Warlord Tang Shengzhi of Hunan has defected and joined us. We have a strong foothold leading up to the city of Wuchang, the base of Wu Peifu.

As for-

- @four: -Guangxi.

@four
go-to: wingxc if guangxi_governor = "Li Zongren"; losegxc

@wingxc
face-image: img/lizongren2.jpg
on-arrival: guangxi_faction = "Guomindang"; gxc_relation += 10; nra_strength += 20;

Li Zongren has sworn to join the Guomindang in our national revolution. His forces will be of good use.

- @five: Yunnan?

@losegxc

[+ guangxi_governor +] has refused to fight with us. Looks like we have to contact more warlords for help.

- @five: Yunnan?

@five
go-to: winyun if yun_relation >= 40; loseyun if yun_relation < 40

@winyun
on-arrival: yun_relation += 10; nra_strength += 20;

After Tang Jiyao's failed invasion of Yunnan, our relations have soured. Still, Tang joins our efforts to reunify China.

- @six: Guangdong.

@loseyun

After Tang Jiyao's failed invasion of Yunnan, our relations have soured. Looks like we're better off without him.

- @six: Guangdong.

@six
go-to: wingdc if fourthtrialdone = 1; losegdc if fourthtrialdone = 0;

@wingdc

After defeating Chen Jiongming, Yang Ximin, Liu Zhenhuan and Deng Benyin, Guangdong is finally <span style="color: #66BB6A;">completely secure</span>. There won't be any problems back there while we march north.

- @seven: Are we ready?

@losegdc

Deng Benyin <span style="color: #d42f2f;">still controls the south</span>. Looks like we'll have some problems back home while fighting.

- @seven: Are we ready?

@seven

Probably. Maybe, maybe not. But whatever the costs, we'll fight for the National Revolution.

- @eight: Whatever it takes.

@eight
on-arrival: northern_expedition_begun = 1;
